<title>USA: Oncogene Science to buy back 1.25 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Oncogene Science to buy back 1.25 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oncogene Science Inc said Tuesday it has repurchased all 1.25 million shares of its common stock previously held by Beckton, Dickinson and Co for about $8.75 million.</p>
<p>The pharmaceutical company said it plans to use the shares to enhance its compound libraries and other components of its drug discovery technologies, and for other corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
